hone, etc.) as MODE, arm/cohort/conditional applicability instructions as APPLICABILITY, and every footnote definition as FOOTNOTE. Use CONTEXT for identity, arm/cohort, assignment and other supporting passages. Narrative-only schedules must also yield visits and assessments. Do not calculate dates or collapse different cycle days. Read table layout from the attached PDF when available. Report unreadable cells, ambiguous header associations and contradictory sources in uncertainties. pages_read must list every requested page actually inspected.
